`pyproject.toml`
: Project configuration file (PEP 621). This is the authoritative source of
  project metadata, version information, and dependency declarations.

Project source directory
: The package source tree inspected by `pfig` when analysing imports,
  dependency intent, and packaging layout.

`pfig_dist/`
: Default output directory for documentation artifacts generated by
  `pfig docs`, including man pages and other render targets.
